        "original_id": "9f09014e-c52e-5ad1-a687-ed4ef898853e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Herbert, Rubens Barrichello\n- Organizations: Stewart Grand Prix\n- Events: 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy, 1995 Formula One World Championship, 1999 Formula One season, European Grand Prix, French Grand Prix, Constructors' Championship\n- Topics: Formula One, motor racing\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Herbert was born on 25 June 1964 and is a British racing driver.\n- Johnny Herbert won the 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy in a Lotus-Ford.\n- Johnny Herbert raced in Formula One from 1989 to 2000 for seven different teams.\n- Johnny Herbert placed fourth in the 1995 Formula One World Championship.\n- Stewart Grand Prix had its strongest season in 1999 and finished fourth overall in the Constructors' Championship.\n- Stewart Grand Prix achieved one win in 1999 when Johnny Herbert won the European Grand Prix.\n- Stewart Grand Prix achieved one pole position in 1999 when Rubens Barrichello took pole at the French Grand Prix.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
